meta {
  name: Model Catalog - List
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/model-catalog
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  The public model picker for an agent's `model_catalog_id` or an
  `ask_ai` workflow node's `model_catalog_slug` config — not
  workspace-scoped, same as `Nodes - List (Global Catalog)`.

  Only active, non-internal catalog entries are returned. Which real
  backend(s) actually serve an entry (`model_routes`, credentials,
  priority/failover order) is never exposed here — see
  `Services\Ai\ModelCatalogResolver`.

  `id` is what `Agents - Update`'s `model_catalog_id` expects; `slug` is
  what an `ask_ai` node's `model_catalog_slug` config expects — pick the
  right one for the endpoint you're calling.

  Response is wrapped: `{ success, statusCode, message, data: { model_catalog: [{ id, slug, display_name, brand, capabilities }] } }`.
}
